          <div class="rmt-mve-layout-scope"><div class="rmt-mve-workspace" data-editor-tab="look" data-editor-paged="false" data-preview-only="false"><section class="rmt-mve-preview" aria-label="手书预览">
            <div class="rmt-mve-preview-head"><span data-rmt-mv-current>第 1 镜 · 4 镜</span><button type="button" class="rmt-x-secondary" data-rmt-mv="editor-preview" aria-pressed="false">只看画面</button></div>
            <div class="rmt-mv-canvas-wrap"><canvas data-rmt-mv-canvas width="960" height="540" aria-label="当前分镜画面"></canvas></div>
            <div class="rmt-mve-transport"><button type="button" class="rmt-mv-play" data-rmt-mv="play" aria-label="播放">▶</button><span class="rmt-mve-clock" data-rmt-mv-time>0:00.0</span><input type="range" min="0" max="16" step="0.1" value="0" data-rmt-mv-seek aria-label="播放位置"><small>0:16</small></div>
            <div class="rmt-mve-projectbar"><button type="button" class="rmt-x-secondary" data-rmt-mv="editor-drawer" data-rmt-mv-id="audio" title="导入音乐" aria-label="导入音乐"><span aria-hidden="true">♪</span> <span>导入音乐</span> <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></button><small class="rmt-mve-meta">静音预览</small></div>
            <div class="rmt-mve-filmstrip" data-rmt-mv-filmstrip><div class="rmt-mve-strip-head"><small data-rmt-mv-selection>第 1 镜 · 4 镜</small><div class="rmt-mve-strip-actions"><button type="button" class="rmt-x-secondary" data-rmt-mv="editor-drawer" data-rmt-mv-id="shots">全部分镜</button></div></div><div class="rmt-mv-strip"><button type="button" class="on" aria-label="第 1 镜" data-rmt-mv="select-shot" data-rmt-mv-id="F1_muwbtgzk"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>1 · 4.0秒</span></button><button type="button" class="" aria-label="第 2 镜" data-rmt-mv="select-shot" data-rmt-mv-id="F2_muwbtgzk"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>2 · 4.0秒</span></button><button type="button" class="" aria-label="第 3 镜" data-rmt-mv="select-shot" data-rmt-mv-id="F3_muwbtgzk"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>3 · 4.0秒</span></button><button type="button" class="" aria-label="第 4 镜" data-rmt-mv="select-shot" data-rmt-mv-id="F4_muwbtgzk"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>4 · 4.0秒</span></button></div></div>
          </section><section class="rmt-mve-tools" aria-label="剪辑工具"><nav class="rmt-mve-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="剪辑工作区"><button type="button" class="rmt-mve-tab" data-rmt-mv="editor-tab" data-rmt-mv-id="shots" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="rmt-mve-active-panel">分镜</button><button type="button" class="rmt-mve-tab" data-rmt-mv="editor-tab" data-rmt-mv-id="timing" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="rmt-mve-active-panel">定段 · 定句</button><button type="button" class="rmt-mve-tab on" data-rmt-mv="editor-tab" data-rmt-mv-id="look" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-pressed="true" aria-controls="rmt-mve-active-panel">全片样式</button></nav><div id="rmt-mve-active-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-label="全片样式" class="rmt-mve-panel"><div class="rmt-mve-panel-scroll" data-rmt-mv-scroll="look"><div class="rmt-x-row-head"><b>整支手书的样子</b><span>全片设置</span></div><div class="rmt-x-segs"><button type="button" class="rmt-x-seg active" data-rmt-mv="editor-ratio" data-rmt-mv-id="16:9" aria-pressed="true">横屏 16:9</button><button type="button" class="rmt-x-seg" data-rmt-mv="editor-ratio" data-rmt-mv-id="9:16" aria-pressed="false">竖屏 9:16</button></div><details><summary>片头与片尾</summary><div><label class="rmt-mv-look"><span>片头时长（秒）</span><input type="number" min="0" step="0.5" inputmode="decimal" data-rmt-mv-intro-seconds value="0"></label><label class="rmt-mv-look"><span>片尾时长（秒）</span><input type="number" min="0" step="0.5" inputmode="decimal" data-rmt-mv-outro-seconds value="0"></label><p class="rmt-x-note">0 为关闭。片头最多占首镜头一半，开唱时结束；片尾最多占所选片段末镜头一半。</p></div></details>
          <details open><summary>字幕与装饰</summary><div><b>歌词样式</b><div class="rmt-x-segs"><button type="button" class="rmt-x-seg active" data-rmt-mv="tegaki-lyric" data-rmt-mv-id="stage" aria-pressed="true">舞台编排</button><button type="button" class="rmt-x-seg" data-rmt-mv="tegaki-lyric" data-rmt-mv-id="vertical" aria-pressed="false">竖排</button><button type="button" class="rmt-x-seg" data-rmt-mv="tegaki-lyric" data-rmt-mv-id="subtitle" aria-pressed="false">字幕</button><button type="button" class="rmt-x-seg" data-rmt-mv="tegaki-lyric" data-rmt-mv-id="big" aria-pressed="false">大字</button><button type="button" class="rmt-x-seg" data-rmt-mv="tegaki-lyric" data-rmt-mv-id="none" aria-pressed="false">不显示</button></div>
          <label class="rmt-mv-check"><input type="checkbox" data-rmt-mv-overlay="keyword" >副歌关键词（随歌词隐藏）</label><label class="rmt-mv-check"><input type="checkbox" data-rmt-mv-overlay="motif" >漂浮装饰</label>
          <b>字体</b><div class="rmt-x-segs"><button type="button" class="rmt-x-seg active" data-rmt-mv="tegaki-font" data-rmt-mv-id="sans" aria-pressed="true">清爽</button><button type="button" class="rmt-x-seg" data-rmt-mv="tegaki-font" data-rmt-mv-id="song" aria-pressed="false">书卷</button><button type="button" class="rmt-x-seg" data-rmt-mv="tegaki-font" data-rmt-mv-id="round" aria-pressed="false">圆润</button></div><p class="rmt-x-note">字体用设备自带的，不同手机效果会略有差异。</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>节奏模板与切换</summary><div><div class="rmt-mv-presets"><button type="button" class="rmt-mv-choice" aria-pressed="false" data-rmt-mv="tegaki-preset" data-rmt-mv-id="quick"><span><b>一人一句快切</b><small>每句歌词一张，干脆直切，节奏紧</small></span></button><button type="button" class="rmt-mv-choice" aria-pressed="false" data-rmt-mv="tegaki-preset" data-rmt-mv-id="flash"><span><b>白闪卡点</b><small>换构图时白闪，副歌每小节轻闪一下</small></span></button><button type="button" class="rmt-mv-choice" aria-pressed="false" data-rmt-mv="tegaki-preset" data-rmt-mv-id="slow"><span><b>抒情慢镜</b><small>构图之间淡入，画面缓慢推近，停留更久</small></span></button></div><p class="rmt-x-note">模板会统一修改镜头切换、停留和歌词样式；之后仍可逐镜调整。</p><b>切换节奏</b><div class="rmt-mv-grid2"><button type="button" class="rmt-x-seg active" data-rmt-mv="tegaki-rhythm" data-rmt-mv-id="line" aria-pressed="true">每句一换</button><button type="button" class="rmt-x-seg" data-rmt-mv="tegaki-rhythm" data-rmt-mv-id="beat" aria-pressed="false">跟着拍子切</button></div></div></details>
          <details><summary>截取范围 · 0:00–0:16</summary><div><div class="rmt-mv-grid2"><button type="button" class="rmt-x-seg" data-rmt-mv="range-pick" data-rmt-mv-id="chorus" aria-pressed="false" data-rmt-mv-scope="record">第一段副歌</button><button type="button" class="rmt-x-seg" data-rmt-mv="range-pick" data-rmt-mv-id="verseChorus" aria-pressed="false" data-rmt-mv-scope="record">一段主歌 + 副歌</button><button type="button" class="rmt-x-seg active" data-rmt-mv="range-pick" data-rmt-mv-id="full" aria-pressed="true" data-rmt-mv-scope="record">整首</button><button type="button" class="rmt-x-seg" data-rmt-mv="range-pick" data-rmt-mv-id="custom" aria-pressed="false" data-rmt-mv-scope="record">自己选</button></div><p class="rmt-x-note">这次做：主歌 1 → 副歌 · 2 段 · 约 3 句歌词。手书通常只做一段，镜头少、节奏紧。</p><p class="rmt-x-note">约 16 秒。只改变预览范围，不删除其他分镜。</p></div></details></div></div></section></div></div>
